-- title: Central dashboard unreachable
-- severity: High
-- url: {central_url}/dashboard
-- expected_text: <title>Frappe Cloud
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 180
-- resolve_after: 300
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/central/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/central-unreachable.md
-- Beacon loads the dashboard page from outside. Customers cannot sign in or manage their sites when it fails. Desk sets the Regions to the Central Telemetry Region.
